# M2: Find, Find Next and Replace All through the Find menu, then undo the replacement as one step.
@copy plain.qld
@open PLAIN.QLD
f10 right right right enter                  # Find > Find...
l i n e enter                          # find "line"
esc
f10 right right right down enter             # Find > Find Next
f10 right right right down down enter        # Find > Replace...
tab r o w tab tab tab tab tab enter    # replace with "row", Replace All
esc
f10 right enter                        # Edit > Undo
f10 down down down down enter          # File > Exit
n
